sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Post API
    participant J as Supabase JWT
    participant S as Storage
    participant R as Redis Stream

    U->>C: Compose post
    C->>A: GET /post-media-urls
    A->>J: Validate Bearer token
    J-->>A: user_id
    A->>S: Create four signed upload URLs
    S-->>A: Signed URLs and media IDs
    A-->>C: 200 signed_upload_urls
    C->>S: Upload selected media
    C->>A: POST /post
    A->>J: Validate Bearer token
    J-->>A: user_id
    A->>A: Validate text, links, media lists
    A->>R: XADD serialized request and user_id
    R-->>A: queue_id
    A-->>C: 202 queued
    C-->>U: Show pending submission

    Note over R: Verifier consumption is not yet implemented.
